<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Inventory & Multi-Warehouse Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Total visibility and control over your physical assets across every location, preventing 
            stockouts and shrinkage while optimizing your balance sheet.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Location Stock Visibility</h2>
        <p>
            Experience a real-time, consolidated view of your inventory levels across all warehouses, 
            regional distribution centers, and retail outlets. The inventory module eliminates 
            the uncertainty of fragmented data, allowing for intelligent stock allocation and 
            efficient inter-location transfers. By knowing exactly what is held where, 
            your organization can significantly reduce the capital tied up in redundant 
            safety stock.
        </p>
        <p>
            Detailed stock profiles include technical specifications, alternative units of 
            measure, and multi-currency landed cost history, providing the operational 
            intelligence needed for effective supply chain management.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Rigorous Traceability and Valuation</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain absolute accountability for every item with integrated lot and serial number 
            tracking. Whether managing pharmaceutical expiry dates or electronic component 
            warranties, the system ensures a complete chain of custody for every unit. Scientific 
            valuation methods (FIFO and Weighted Average Costing) ensure that your inventory 
            value on the balance sheet is always accurate and IAS 2 compliant.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated reorder points and min-max replenishment alerts trigger procurement requests 
            before stockouts occur, maintaining operational continuity without manual 
            monitoring of thousands of SKUs.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Governance and Physical Verification</h2>
        <p>
            Combat shrinkage and obsolescence with structured cycle counting and full stock-take 
            management workflows. Variance capture with required reason codes provides the data 
            needed to identify and address the root causes of inventory leakage. Detailed 
            reports on slow-moving and obsolete stock allow for proactive discounting and 
            disposal strategies, protecting your organizational profitability.
        </p>
        <p>
            QR and barcode scanning via mobile devices accelerates physical verification and 
            stock movement tasks, improving accuracy and reducing the labor hours required 
            for inventory stewardship.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

